An '''Agarimoo''' is a {{Rare}} [[Sea Creature]].

== Spawning ==
An '''Agarimoo''' has a {{Chance|15%|1|6.67|sea creatures}} base chance to override other Sea Creature spawns in water near {{Item|Empty Chumcap Bucket}} that the player placed themselves with {{Skill|Fishing|15}} or higher. This roll happens after the roll for hotspot sea creatures. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it. 

